This build is used to run the Dungeon [[gww:Oola%27s_Lab|Oola's Lab]] without consets in order to get the rare [[gww:Clockwork_Scythe|Clockwork Scythe]], [[gww:Crystal_Flame_Staff|Crystal Flame Staff]], [[gww:Steelhead_Scythe|Steelhead Scythe]], or the sought after [[gww:Storm_Daggers|Storm Daggers]].  This is done even without the use of [[gww:Perma_Shadow_Form|Perma Shadow Form]].  However, Alcohol is required and at least a cupcake is recommended.

