== Equipment ==
'''Required'''
* Full Blessed Insignias.
* Sword, Spear, or Axe with +5 energy and +20% longer Enchantments.
* ''If you are bringing the A/D variant, a Scythe with +1 energy gain on hit, +5 energy, and a +20% longer Enchanting mod is required.''
* Shield with +45HP (while enchanted) and +10 AR vs. Blunt.
* Longbow with +5 energy and +20% longer Enchantments.
* Alcohol.

'''Recommended'''
* Shield with +45HP (while enchanted) and +10 AR vs. Lightning.
* A staff with +5 energy mod and a +20% longer Enchantments mod.  It is recommended that the staff does '''NOT''' deal elemental damage due to [[gww:TPS_Regulator_Golem|TPS Regulator Golem's]] effect.
* A Dagger set with +1 Energy gain on hit, +5 energy, and a +20% longer Enchanting mod.

== Usage ==
=== Getting There ===
<pvxbig>
* You must have the quest [[gww:Little_Workshop_of_Horrors|"Little Workshop of Horrors"]] active.
* Enter [[gww:Magus_Stones|Magus Stones]] from [[gww:Rata_Sum|Rata Sum]] to run to the dungeon.
* Run either of the routes below.
{|
|-
|<big>'''Fast Way'''</big><br />
[[Image:Oola's_Lab_route_fast.jpg| 400px]]
|<big>'''Safe Way'''</big><br />
[[Image:Oola's_Lab_route_safe.jpg| 400px]]
|}
* Maintain [[Dark Escape@16] with [[Dwarven Stability] at all times.
* Use [[Shadow Form@16] and [[Shroud of Distress@16] when running through enemies.  Always have [[Shadow Form@16] up when running through the [[gww:Wind_Rider|Winds Riders]].
* Use [["I Am Unstoppable!"] to avoid getting KDed by the [[gww:Heket|Heket]].
</pvxbig>

----
=== Level 1 ===
<pvxbig>
* Pop Alcohol and other Pcons if you brought them.
* Precast all enchantments and run through level 1.
**Always have [[Shadow Form@16] up at the [[gww:Xien|Xien]] spawning points.  Otherwise, he will cast {{skill pvxicon|Shadow Prison}} on you and slow you down which could kill you.
* When you get to the end, break aggro of the [[gww:golem|Golems]], and switch to your longbow.  Precast your enchantments including [[Shadow Form@16] and hug the left wall and target, attack, and pull Xien out from the Golems.  Do not aggro the Golems.
* Pull Xien to the door and cast your damage skill(s) on him until he gets to low health at which point the key will spawn.
* Grab key and zone to level 2.
</pvxbig>

----
=== Level 2 ===
<pvxbig>
* Pop Alcohol and other Pcons if you brought them.
* Run to the [[gww:Malfunctioning_Enduring_Golem|Malfunctioning Enduring Golem]].
* Before running into aggro range, precast your enchantments '''except''' for [[Shadow Form@16].
* Run up and grab the [[gww:Flux_Matrix|Flux Matrix]] and walk backwards to pull the Enduring Golem.
**With Shadow Form up, the Enduring Golem is harder to pull.
* Pull the Enduring Golem to the [[gww:Unstable_Magical_Energy_Storage|Unstable Magical Energy Storage]].
* While holding the FLux Matrix, click on the Energy Storage and drop the Flux Matrix afterwards to deal damage to the Enduring Golem.  Keep repeating this process until the Enduring Golem Dies.
**Avoid standing in the Flame Jet, maintain your enchantments (you can maintain [[Shadow Form@16] at this point), and use [[Heart of Shadow@16] to heal yourself.
* Once it is dead, run back to where you picked up the Flux Matrix and grab the key.
* Run to and zone to level 3.
</pvxbig>

----
=== Level 3 ===
* There is no need for Pcons on this level.
* Run to the [[gww:TPS_Regulator_Golem|TPS Regulator Golem]].
* Run to the other side of the TPS Golem without aggroing the other two on either side of it and pull it to the back wall where the flame arrows cannot touch you.
* Cast your damage skill(s) on the TPS Golem until it dies.
**Do '''NOT''' attack with a weapon that deals elemental damage due to the TPS Regulator Golem's effect [[gww:Unstable_Pulse|Unstable Pulse]].

== Counters ==
* Knock down
* Xien casts Shadow Prison on you.
* Using a weapon that deals elemental damage on [[gww:TPS_Regulator_Golem|TPS Regulator Golem]].

== Notes ==
* Perma Shadow Form is not necessary.
* Alcohol is required and at least a cupcake is recommended.

